#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "184_Hana"
msgid "Hi, Chief. Shoko-san's here."
msgstr "Bienvenido, Jefe.\nShoko-san le está esperando."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "196_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, is she? That was fast."
msgstr "Oh, ¿de verdad? Qué rápida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "268_Akiyama"
msgid "So how did you spend your million yen?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿cómo gastaste tu millón de yenes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "280_Shoko"
msgid "I haven't yet."
msgstr "Aún no lo he hecho."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "292_Akiyama"
msgid "Huh? But..."
msgstr "¿Eh? Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "304_Shoko"
msgid "The sushi restaurant, the host club... You have far too much\\r\ntime on your hands, Akiyama-san."
msgstr "El restaurante de sushi, el host club... De verdad tienes mucho tiempo libre, Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "316_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh... So you saw me."
msgstr "Oh... así que te diste cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "328_Shoko"
msgid "Yes, well. You're not exactly subtle. Thank goodness you're\\r\nin finance; you'd make an awful detective."
msgstr "Obviamente. No eres exactamente lo que llaman sutil. Gracias a Dios eres prestamista; serías un horrible detective."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "340_Akiyama"
msgid "I shouldn't have been so nosy. My apologies. So, what are\\r\nyou going to do with the money?"
msgstr "No debería haber sido tan metiche. Mis disculpas.\nEntonces... ¿qué harás con el millón?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "352_Shoko"
msgid "This million yen will go toward paying off my debts once\\r\nyou've consolidated them."
msgstr "Este millón de yenes irá a pagar mis deudas en cuanto las hayas agrupado todas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "364_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "376_Shoko"
msgid "All this time, I've been investing in my future self, and\\r\nI've borrowed a lot of money along the way."
msgstr "Todo este tiempo, estuve acumulando deudas con el único propósito de invertir en mi futuro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "388_Shoko"
msgid "But I've come to understand that other people's money can't\\r\nbuy my future."
msgstr "Pero comprendí que no puedo comprar mi futuro con el dinero de otras personas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "400_Shoko"
msgid "My future can only be bought with money I've earned myself.\\r\nAnd that's why..."
msgstr "Mi futuro solo puede ser comprado con dinero que haya ganado yo misma. Es por eso que..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "412_Shoko"
msgid "...I'll use this million yen you gave me to pay down my\\r\ndebts."
msgstr "...usaré este millón de yenes que me diste para pagar mis deudas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "424_Akiyama"
msgid "I have to admit I'm surprised. Quite frankly, it's a better\\r\nuse than I expected."
msgstr "Ya veo, qué gratificante sorpresa. Francamente, es un mejor uso del que yo hubiera pensado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "436_Akiyama"
msgid "I figured you'd put that million toward paying down some of\\r\nyour current loan shark debts."
msgstr "Imaginé que ibas a usar ese millón para pagar algunas deudas, como esa que tienes con los usureros."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "448_Shoko"
msgid "Well, I'd thought about it... But then I believed you when\\r\nyou said you'd consolidate them for me."
msgstr "Se me pasó por la cabeza, pero... después decidí creerte cuando me dijiste que las consolidarías por mí."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "460_Shoko"
msgid "If you'd refused to go through with it, then I would have\\r\ngiven back every last yen."
msgstr "Y si al final decidieras no ayudarme con eso... entonces te hubiera devuelto hasta el último yen."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "472_Shoko"
msgid "My pride won't allow me to accept money for no good reason.\\r\nI happen to have a great deal of self-respect."
msgstr "Es mi orgullo el que no me permite aceptar dinero sin una buena razón. Soy una mujer con gran respeto hacia mí misma."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "484_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, in that case, I'd say you've passed－and with flying\\r\ncolors. You should be proud of yourself; you did better than I expected."
msgstr "En ese caso, diría que aprobaste. ¡Y con una nota sobresaliente! Lo has hecho mejor de lo que esperaba."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "496_Shoko"
msgid "I've passed the test? But how?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Aprobé la prueba? ¿Pero cómo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "508_Akiyama"
msgid "I told myself that if you, of your own free will, chose to\\r\npay down your debts, you'd pass. But you showed me an even\\r\nbetter solution."
msgstr "Me dije a mí mismo que si por tu propia voluntad escogieras pagar tus deudas, aprobarías. Pero me diste una respuesta que superó mis expectativas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "520_Shoko"
msgid "Akiyama-san..."
msgstr "Akiyama-san..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "532_Akiyama"
msgid "Sky Finance will handle all your debts from here, Shoko-san."
msgstr "Sky finance se encargará de tus deudas de ahora en adelante, Shoko-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "544_Shoko"
msgid "Thank you... It seems I was wrong about you. Truthfully, I'd\\r\nthought you were just some sarcastic jerk."
msgstr "Gracias. Creo que estaba equivocada contigo. A decir verdad, pensaba que eras otro tipo desagradable del montón."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "556_Akiyama"
msgid "Really? Well... I liked you right away."
msgstr "¿En serio? Bueno... tú me caíste bien de inmediato."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "568_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan! Could you please do a survey of Shoko-san's debts\\r\nand write up a contract for us?"
msgstr "¡Hana-chan! ¿Podrías investigar el monto total de las deudas de Shoko-san y así redactar un contrato?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "580_Hana"
msgid "Yes, right away."
msgstr "Claro, lo revisaré de inmediato."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "664_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, we're done for today. You'll be working with Hana-chan\\r\non the details."
msgstr "En fin, eso sería todo por hoy. Habla con Hana-chan para arreglar los detalles."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "676_Shoko"
msgid "All right. Thank you in advance."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Gracias por todo. Es un placer tener a alguien como usted."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "688_Akiyama"
msgid "You're welcome. Oh, and... would you care to join me for\\r\ndinner?"
msgstr "El placer es todo mío. Oh, y... ¿qué te parece si vamos a cenar más tarde?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "700_Hana"
msgid "Chief!"
msgstr "¡Jefe!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "712_Shoko"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I couldn't possibly make your darling\\r\nsecretary angry. Who knows what she'd do to my contract?"
msgstr "Lo siento. Pero no quisiera enfadar a tu linda secretaria. Quien sabe qué podría hacer con mi contrato."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "724_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, right..."
msgstr "Ah... claro..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "736_Shoko"
msgid "Here, this is for you. It was a gift, but I think it suits\\r\nyou."
msgstr "Pero toma, esto es para ti. Era un regalo que me hicieron, pero creo que te quedaría mejor a ti, Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "772_Shoko"
msgid "Today was fun. I'll be seeing you again."
msgstr "La pasé genial hoy. ¡Nos vemos!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "832_Hana"
msgid "Too bad, huh, Chief?"
msgstr "Qué mal... Lo siento, Jefe."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "844_Akiyama"
msgid "Say, Hana-chan, you wouldn't want to grab a bite to eat,\\r\nwould you?"
msgstr "Hana-chan, ¿no te gustaría salir a comer más tarde?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "856_Hana"
msgid "Me instead of Shoko-san, you mean?"
msgstr "¿Te refieres a que sea el remplazo de Shoko-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "868_Akiyama"
msgid "No, that's not..."
msgstr "No, eso no es lo que trataba de decir..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "880_Hana"
msgid "Are you sure? I can easily put away a hundred pieces of\\r\notoro at Sushi Gin, you know."
msgstr "Pero ¿está seguro? Fácilmente puedo hacer desaparecer cien piezas de otoro en el Sushi Gin."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "892_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, uh, never mind. I'll just pop out for a little something\\r\non my own..."
msgstr "Oh, no... mejor olvídalo. Iré a comer solo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "964_Hana"
msgid "Oh, hello, Chief. Didn't expect you back so soon."
msgstr "Oh, bienvenido, Jefe. ¡No pensé que volvería tan pronto!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "976_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, you know... Can't stroll around town forever. Do you\\r\nhave any work for me?"
msgstr "Bueno, ya sabes... no puedo andar de vago todo el tiempo. ¿Tienes algo de trabajo para mí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1000_Hana"
msgid "I took care of all the paperwork, so... Oh, I know! Could\\r\nyou please clean up your desk area? There's just so much\\r\njunk everywhere!"
msgstr "a me encargué de todo el papeleo, así que... ¡Oh, ya sé! ¿Podría, por favor, limpiar su escritorio? ¡Parece un basurero!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1036_Akiyama"
msgid "But I thought you were in charge of cleaning up around\\r\nhere..."
msgstr "Pero pensé que tú eras la encargada de limpiar el lugar..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1048_Hana"
msgid "The last time I tried tidying up your desk, you kept\\r\npestering me for this document, that magazine... All you did\\r\nwas complain!"
msgstr "La última vez que traté de ordenar tu escritorio, no parabas de decir que no estaban tus documentos o tus revistitas... ¡No hacías más que quejarte!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1060_Hana"
msgid "I don't know what you'll end up needing, and if I move\\r\nanything at all, I guarantee I'll hear about it. Thus, I've\\r\nsworn off cleaning up your desk."
msgstr "No sé qué acabará necesitando y qué no, y si muevo algo, le garantizo que se quejará. Por lo tanto, me he jurado a mí misma no volver a limpiar su escritorio."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1072_Akiyama"
msgid "Bummer..."
msgstr "Qué mal...\nSupongo que se quedará así..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1144_Shoko"
msgid "Excuse me, is this Sky Finance? Is there an Akiyama-san\\r\nhere?"
msgstr "Disculpen, ¿este es Sky Finance? ¿Se encuentra Akiyama-san aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1156_Hana"
msgid "Oh, hello. And welcome."
msgstr "Oh. Bienvenida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1168_Hana"
msgid "Chief! You have a customer."
msgstr "¡¡Jefe!! Tiene una clienta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1180_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, Shoko-san. Good to see you. Why don't you tell me\\r\nmore about your situation? Please, have a seat."
msgstr "Ah, Shoko-san. Me alegro de verte. ¿Por qué no me cuentas más sobre tu situación? Por favor, toma asiento."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1192_Shoko"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1264_Shoko"
msgid "This office certainly is dirty. Can you really conduct\\r\nbusiness here?"
msgstr "Esta oficina está toda sucia. ¿De verdad haces negocios aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1276_Akiyama"
msgid "You should have seen it before we tidied up... Apologies for\\r\nthe mess."
msgstr "Y eso que la acabamos de ordenar... Disculpa las molestias."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1288_Akiyama"
msgid "So, how much do you owe at the moment? Did you check the\\r\nexact amount?"
msgstr "Bueno pues, ¿cuánto es tu deuda ahora mismo? ¿Tienes la cifra exacta?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1300_Shoko"
msgid "I owe five credit card companies and four loan sharks. 10.3\\r\nmillion yen in all. Although that's not including\\r\ninterest..."
msgstr "Veamos, debo dinero de cinco tarjetas de crédito y cuatro prestamistas informales. Serían 10,3 millones de yenes en total. Eso sin incluir intereses."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1312_Akiyama"
msgid "I see... Well, it sounds like you have a pretty good idea of\\r\nwhere you stand. Still, it must be hard paying it off when\\r\nit's spread all over like that."
msgstr "Ya veo... Parece que estás al tanto de tu situación. Pero al tener una deuda tan repartida, debe ser difícil pagarla."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1324_Akiyama"
msgid "Er... Why did you borrow so much exactly?"
msgstr "Por cierto... ¿Cómo fue que terminaste con tantas deudas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1336_Shoko"
msgid "I wanted to invest in myself－wear nice clothes, carry the\\r\nlatest accessories, and date good men..."
msgstr "Necesitaba invertir en mí misma. Ya sabes, vestir ropa bonita, llevar el mejor bolso, un reloj precioso y salir con hombres guapos..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1348_Shoko"
msgid "I can't have anybody taking me lightly. I may have borrowed\\r\nsome money, but it's only because I'll be earning millions\\r\none day."
msgstr "No puedo permitir que nadie me tome a la ligera. Puede que ahora tenga algunas deudas, pero no importa, algún día ganaré muchísimo dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1360_Akiyama"
msgid "Aha... Well, that's some sound logic, but it seems to me you\\r\nmight've rushed things a little..."
msgstr "Ya veo... Bueno, es una lógica sólida, pero me parece que te has apresurado un poco..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1372_Shoko"
msgid "Maybe so... Simply improving my appearance hasn't helped\\r\nmuch. It's just not that easy."
msgstr "Puede que sí... De nada sirve verse bonita. No es tan simple como pensaba."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1384_Akiyama"
msgid "As long as you understand that, you should be fine. You can\\r\nalways start over."
msgstr "Mientras lo entiendas, estarás bien. Siempre se puede empezar de nuevo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1396_Akiyama"
msgid "First, I recommend consolidating all your loans and coming\\r\nup with a repayment plan. What do you think?"
msgstr "En primer lugar, te recomiendo consolidar todos tus préstamos en uno solo y crear un nuevo plan de pago. ¿Qué te parece la idea?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1408_Shoko"
msgid "I think that's a good idea. Do you do loan consolidation\\r\nhere?"
msgstr "Me gusta. ¿Aquí también puedo consolidar mis préstamos?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1420_Akiyama"
msgid "Yes, of course. With no interest and no collateral."
msgstr "Sí, por supuesto. Sin intereses ni necesidad de avales."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1432_Shoko"
msgid "What!? No interest? Then, what's in it for you?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?! ¿Sin intereses? ¿Y tú, cómo obtienes ganancias con ello?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1444_Akiyama"
msgid "That's nothing for you to worry about. Or would you prefer\\r\nto pay interest?"
msgstr "Eso no es asunto suyo, Shoko-san. ¿O es que quiere que le cobre intereses?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1456_Shoko"
msgid "Oh, I get it. You have some kind of conditions, don't you?\\r\nLike... I have to sleep with you."
msgstr "Oh, ya veo por dónde va el asunto. Tienes algún tipo de condiciones, ¿no? Algo como ser tu amiga cariñosa y eso..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1468_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, that sounds great... But, no. You're a little off\\r\nbase."
msgstr "Bueno, eso suena genial... pero no. Es algo completamente distinto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1480_Akiyama"
msgid "All I ask is that you take a test."
msgstr "Lo único que te pido es que hagas una prueba."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1492_Shoko"
msgid "A test?"
msgstr "¿Una prueba...?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1504_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. A test. Pass the test and I'll consolidate your debts,\\r\nno interest, no collateral."
msgstr "Sí. Una prueba. Y si la apruebas, consolidaré todas tus deudas, sin interés y sin avales."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1516_Shoko"
msgid "So... what kind of test are we talking about?"
msgstr "Entonces... ¿de qué tipo de prueba estamos hablando?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1528_Akiyama"
msgid "I have one million yen here. I'm going to give it to you,\\r\nand then it'll be your job to decide how to spend it."
msgstr "Tengo un millón de yenes aquí. Toma, ahora son tuyos. Tu trabajo será encontrar el mejor uso posible para ellos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1540_Shoko"
msgid "Huh? I just have to spend one million yen?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Solo debo que gastar un millón de yenes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1552_Akiyama"
msgid "Pretty much. So what do you say?"
msgstr "Así es. Entonces, ¿qué me dices? ¿Harás la prueba?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1564_Shoko"
msgid "All right. I accept."
msgstr "...De acuerdo. Acepto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1576_Akiyama"
msgid "Then, it's a deal. Use every last yen of this one million."
msgstr "Entonces, es un trato. Gasta hasta el último yen de este millón."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1648_Shoko"
msgid "I'll be back when it's gone. See you then."
msgstr "Volveré cuando se me acabe. Nos vemos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1720_Hana"
msgid "Chief! Are you sure about this!? That's a million yen you\\r\njust gave her!"
msgstr "¡Jefe! ¡¿Está seguro de esto?! ¡Le acaba de regalar un millón de yenes!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1732_Akiyama"
msgid "I gave it to her, yes, but, then again, I didn't <Italic>just</Italic> give\\r\nit to her."
msgstr "Bueno, técnicamente se los regalé, pero hay <Italic>un motivo oculto</Italic>."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1744_Hana"
msgid "And yet, you were reluctant to give me a bonus..."
msgstr "O sea, ahora regala dinero, pero para darme un bono..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1756_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, er... Look, this is a test to see how Shoko-san spends\\r\nher money!"
msgstr "P-pero... ¡Esto es solo una prueba para saber cómo gasta Shoko-san su dinero!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1768_Akiyama"
msgid "It's hard to spend borrowed money, but when it's a gift, the\\r\nsky's the limit. One's spending habits can give you a pretty\\r\ngood idea of one's character."
msgstr "Cuesta gastar dinero prestado, pero cuando es un regalo, el cielo es el límite. Además, la forma en que alguien gasta dinero dice mucho de su persona."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1780_Hana"
msgid "...You think so?"
msgstr "...¿Usted cree?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1792_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan, if somebody gave you money, you'd make a beeline\\r\nfor a dessert buffet. That tells us you're a foodie, right?"
msgstr "Hana-chan, cuando recibes dinero vas directamente a un buffet de pasteles o algo así, ¿no? Eso nos da a entender que te gusta comer bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1804_Hana"
msgid "Well, yeah, I guess, but..."
msgstr "Supongo que sí, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1816_Akiyama"
msgid "I really admire Shoko-san wanting to move up in the world.\\r\nNow I just want to know if she can see past today..."
msgstr "Admiro su ambición, no me disgusta. Ahora quiero saber si puede ver más allá del presente...\n"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1828_Hana"
msgid "Hmm. Well, with all that yen, I suppose she should pay down\\r\nher debt."
msgstr "Mmm... con ese millón de yenes, debería empezar por pagar su deuda de una vez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1840_Akiyama"
msgid "That's one way to use it. It's much better than spending it\\r\non a bunch of junk."
msgstr "Esa es una de las maneras de usarlo. Es mucho mejor que gastarlo en comprar cosas de lujo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1852_Akiyama"
msgid "Say, Hana-chan, where do you think she'll go?"
msgstr "Dime, Hana-chan, ¿a dónde crees que irá?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1864_Hana"
msgid "For designer goods? Le Marche. For food, Sushi Gin."
msgstr "¿Para cosas de diseñador? Le Marche. Para comida, al Sushi Gin."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1876_Hana"
msgid "And for fun, the host club Adam. Those would be my guesses."
msgstr "Y para divertirse, al host club ADAM. Esas serían mis apuestas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1888_Akiyama"
msgid "Could you give those places a call and tell them to try to\\r\nget her to spend money?"
msgstr "¿Podrías llamar a esos lugares y pedirles que intenten convencerla de que gaste todo su dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1900_Hana"
msgid "Okay... But you know something, Chief? You really are a bad\\r\nman."
msgstr "Está bien... ¿Pero sabe algo, jefe? Usted es un hombre maaaalo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1912_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, it <Italic>is</Italic> a test. I have to make it challenging, don't I?"
msgstr "Oye, <Italic>es</Italic>una prueba. Debo hacerlo desafiante, ¿no crees?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1924_Akiyama"
msgid "Thanks, Hana-chan. I'll go see how she's doing."
msgstr "Cuento contigo para ello. Ahora iré a ver cómo le va."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1936_Akiyama"
msgid "Le Marche and Sushi Gin. Oh, and that host club, Adam."
msgstr "Le Marche y el Sushi Gin. Oh, y no hay que olvidar ese host club ADAM."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1948_Akiyama"
msgid "Where's Adam again?"
msgstr "Por cierto, ¿dónde estaba el club ADAM?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1960_Hana"
msgid "Near the center of the Hotel District."
msgstr "Detrás del distrito hotelero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1972_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, that's right. Okay, I'm off."
msgstr "Es verdad, es verdad. Bueno, voy saliendo."

